{"version":1,"content":"<p>據《自然》（Nature）雜誌11月2日報道，一種名為Neuropixels的超細神經探針正在改變科學家研究大腦的方式。這種比人類頭髮還細的設備，能夠同時記錄數百個神經元的電活動，讓研究人員以前所未有的精細程度觀察大腦內部的信息處理過程。目前，這項技術已從動物實驗逐步進入人類大腦研究。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1584802.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:22:46.217046+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T06:02:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T06:18:39.799619+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:18:39.799619+00:00","content_hash":"6f490d8d58e95159e282b584ed75e259142357f4f6410036c85d7ebdaeed13ad","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}